'''Gold Icecrusher''' is a [[Unique Weapons|Unique]] [[:Category:Knives|knife]] that was awarded to the player who finished '''1st''' on the [[Christmas Event 2022]] Gifts-Given Leaderboard.

== Appearance ==
The Gold Icecrusher has the same appearance as the final stage of [[Icecrusher]], but replacing the light blue color with a golden coloring.

== Trivia ==
*In order to obtain this item, participants collected as many [[Snow Tokens]] in order to purchase gifts to give to other players. The total amount of gifts given would determine their rank in the leaderboard.
*Other variants of this include [[Red Icecrusher]], [[Bronze Icecrusher]], and [[Silver Icecrusher]].
*This item is [[Trading|untradable]].
*It was designed by [[IDontHaveAUse]].
*The sole owner of this knife is [https://www.roblox.com/users/138579882/profile SimplyALemon].

